  { "slug": "cac-ltv", "term": "CAC / LTV", "zh_name": "獲客成本 / 終身價值", "category": "concept", "langs": ["general"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "CAC = 拉到一個用戶花多少錢；LTV = 一個用戶一生帶來多少收入。LTV > CAC 生意才划算。", "related": ["conversion-rate", "churn"] },
